WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.679
"The hill is tall," said Cat.

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.409
"The sled will go fast," said Dog.

3
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.543
"Dog, show us how to slide!" said Cat.

4
00:00:19.544 --> 00:00:25.211
Dog sat on the sled.

5
00:00:25.212 --> 00:00:27.471
Down he went!

6
00:00:27.472 --> 00:00:44.405
"Whee!" cried Dog.

7
00:00:44.406 --> 00:00:47.628
Dog came back up the hill.

8
00:00:47.629 --> 00:00:50.742
"I'll go now," said Pig.

9
00:00:50.743 --> 00:01:03.974
"I'll go too!" said Cat.

10
00:01:03.975 --> 00:01:07.036
Down they went.

11
00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:11.035
"Whee!" cried Cat.

12
00:01:11.036 --> 00:01:17.233
"Whee!" cried Pig.

13
00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.539
Then the sled tipped!

14
00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:22.800
"Oh no!" cried Cow.

15
00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:26.433
Pig and Cat fell off the sled.

16
00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.708
They fell into the snow.

17
00:01:28.709 --> 00:01:32.526
But Pig got up fast.

18
00:01:32.527 --> 00:01:41.530
So did Cat.

19
00:01:41.531 --> 00:01:46.855
They came back up the hill.

20
00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:49.535
Pig gave the sled to Cow.

21
00:01:49.536 --> 00:01:53.479
"It's your turn now," said Pig.

22
00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:56.496
"No thanks," said Cow.

23
00:01:56.497 --> 00:02:00.770
"Let's do something new!"

